  "description": "Get more from every ride\nOur latest full-power, full-torque – all the time – ELyte EVO RS will help you make the most of your precious time, every ride: go farther, faster; enjoy more fun trails; hone your skills; explore further, and grow in confidence. With a full carbon frame, a super low centre of gravity for the finest, most capable handling, and the latest Bosch CX motor, ELyte EVO RS will inspire you with the very best mountain bike ride feel with full-power capability. All so you can get more out of every ride.\n\nHighlights\n– 150mm front + 142mm rear of custom-tuned suspension travel.\n– Uni-directional carbon fibre frame is light and reassuringly strong.\n– Bosch's fifth generation Performance Line CX full-torque full-power motor\n– Ready for the latest software upgrade to unlock E-MTB+ mode (July 2025), plus 100Nm torque + 750W peak power (available October 2025).\n– 650Wh of combined battery (400Wh internal + 250Wh PowerMore range extender) so you can ride further.\n– MX wheels (29er front, 27.5in rear) so you can tackle the techiest terrain.\n– 505.07mm complete bike centre of gravity for the best handling possible.\n\nComponents that perform ride after ride\nThe ELyte EVO RS is dressed in a curated parts list of trail-proven, real-world kit that performs out of the box and as well as for the long haul: RockShox Lyrik Select+ fork and Deluxe Select+ rear shock deliver exceptional rough terrain control; SRAM Eagle T-Type 1x12 gearing, Maxxis tyres, feedback-rich SRAM DB8 four-piston brakes, and more. Our own custom suspension from RockShox has also been meticulously tuned to deliver you outstanding, ground-hugging grip with the support you need right from your first pedal stroke.\n\nCharge time: 50% in 1.5hrs from empty, and to 100% in 3.5hrs.\n\nELyte EVO RS: time saver, fun maker.",
